Battenmark
Copyright 2026 Battenmark contributors

Battenmark is open, backend-neutral CAD infrastructure for AI agents and
software. "AgentCAD" appears as a historical module/CLI/API prefix
(AgentCadService, AGENTCAD_* environment variables, agentcad-mcp, ...) and is
retained as a compatibility surface; it is not a separate product.

